# Hash-verified data: keep bytes stable across platforms so sha256 chains still validate after a
# checkout. Artifacts are content-addressed (filename == sha256(bytes)) — treat as binary, never
# convert. The JSONL ledgers are re-parsed on verify, but pin them to LF for byte-stability too.
attesta-mcp/seed/artifacts/** -text
attesta-mcp/seed/ledger.jsonl text eol=lf
attesta-mcp/bench-results/latest.json text eol=lf
